## Key Concepts
- Kleene 3-valued semantics; - Implication via NOT A OR B; - Backtracking propagation; - Handling Unknowns in constraint systems.

## Code Example
```javascript
const order = {T:2, U:1, F:0};
function not(a){ return a==='T'?'F':a==='F'?'T':'U';}
function or(a,b){ return (a==='T'||b==='T')?'T':(a==='U'||b==='U')?'U':'F';}
function and(a,b){ return (a==='F'||b==='F')?'F':(a==='U'||b==='U')?'U':'T';}
